{"id":4820,"date":"2024-07-09T06:43:50","date_gmt":"2024-07-09T06:43:50","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/?page_id=4820"},"modified":"2025-03-27T14:00:50","modified_gmt":"2025-03-27T14:00:50","slug":"barcelona2025","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/workshops\/barcelona2025\/","title":{"rendered":"Barcelona 2025"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Welcome to SWAT4HCLS 2025: Bridging Life Sciences and Technology<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><a href=\"https:\/\/photos.app.goo.gl\/oZiBNAZDGmLbRcND7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"682\" src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/SWAT4HCLS-Barcelona-26th-February-2025-109-1024x682.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5143\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/SWAT4HCLS-Barcelona-26th-February-2025-109-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/SWAT4HCLS-Barcelona-26th-February-2025-109-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/SWAT4HCLS-Barcelona-26th-February-2025-109-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/SWAT4HCLS-Barcelona-26th-February-2025-109-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/SWAT4HCLS-Barcelona-26th-February-2025-109.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Click group photo (above) to view photo album.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/SWAT4HCLS-Barcelona-25th-February-2025-025.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"682\" src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/SWAT4HCLS-Barcelona-25th-February-2025-025-1024x682.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5141\" style=\"width:216px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/SWAT4HCLS-Barcelona-25th-February-2025-025-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/SWAT4HCLS-Barcelona-25th-February-2025-025-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/SWAT4HCLS-Barcelona-25th-February-2025-025-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/SWAT4HCLS-Barcelona-25th-February-2025-025-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/SWAT4HCLS-Barcelona-25th-February-2025-025.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">[A link to order the Barcelona themed SWAT4HCLS hoodies directly from Promio coming here soon.]<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Date:<\/strong> February 24-27, 2025<br><strong>Location:<\/strong> Barcelona, Spain<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Embark on a four-day exploration at SWAT4HCLS 2025 in Barcelona, Spain where we explore the convergence of data integration, semantic technologies, and life sciences. Since our inception in 2008, we have grown from a focused workshop into a comprehensive four-day event, encompassing tutorials, conferences, and hackathons.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our conference\u2019s scope embraces life sciences as a collective term encompassing healthcare, biology, biodiversity, and agriscience. This inclusive approach allows us to address the multifaceted challenges and opportunities in biomedical and life science domains, emphasizing data-driven approaches and stellar data management practices.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">SWAT4HCLS 2025 is&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/workshops\/barcelona2025\/programme\/\"><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/workshops\/barcelona2025\/programme\/\">more than just a conference<\/a>; it\u2019s a confluence of diverse perspectives and expertise. We are committed to fostering an open, dynamic dialogue transcending the traditional boundaries of academia, industry, and institutional frameworks. Whether you\u2019re with us in beautiful  Barcelona or engaging remotely, we guarantee an interactive experience with live streaming and chat-based participation.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/workshops\/barcelona2025\/call-for-papers\/\">Prepare<\/a>&nbsp;for an event as informative as it is groundbreaking, where ideas intersect, professional networks expand, and the future of life sciences and semantic technologies unfolds.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/workshops\/barcelona2025\/registration\/\">Join us<\/a>&nbsp;at SWAT4HCLS 2025 \u2013 where the worlds of biology, biodiversity, healthcare, and <strong>agriscience<\/strong> meet the cutting-edge of technology.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<!-- START SOCIAL MEDIA WIDGET --><ul id=\"servicesbar\">\n<li id=\"mastodon\" style=\"padding-right:10px !important;\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/genomic.social\/@swat4hcls\" rel=\"noopener\"><IMG src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/screen-icon-swat4ls-mastodon@2x.png\" alt=\"SWAT4HCLS on Mastodon\"><\/a><\/li>\n<li id=\"bluesky\" style=\"padding-right:10px !important;\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/bsky.app\/profile\/swat4hcls.bsky.social\" rel=\"noopener\"><IMG src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/icon-swat4ls-bluesky@2x.png\" alt=\"SWAT4HCLS on Bluesky\"><\/a><\/li>\n\n<li id=\"YouTube\" style=\"padding-right:10px !important;\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/channel\/UCO65ployuRweYHpRFeVe1Mg\" rel=\"noopener\"><IMG src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/screen-icon-swat4ls-youtube@2x.png\" alt=\"SWAT4HCLS on Youtube\"><\/a><\/li><\/ul>